abstract: "Processed results, reference data, OpenFOAM v2606 case template, generation and post-processing scripts, and figure/table sources for a conjugate heat-transfer study of pulsed and intermittent coolant flow in single-phase dielectric immersion cooling of a six-cell 18650 module (submitted to Applied Thermal Engineering, 2026). Code: MIT; data and figures: CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE)."
